<pending_commit branch="master" change_id="Id995a6d5fce044db52efa5c4bf846359cca56999" commit="2aaad519a75513d3a92faeb4469c75f5e8bb9a4f" commit_message="Revert &quot;scarlet: support rearrangement of warm_reset&quot;  Use 'remap' on the board overlays instead. Another change will follow.  CQ-DEPEND=CL:719597 BUG=b:67756253 TEST=Pending to the change follows.  This reverts commit aa2702f0352c7148619522b7764e7bac545749f4.  Change-Id: Id995a6d5fce044db52efa5c4bf846359cca56999 Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/719596 Commit-Ready: Wai-Hong Tam &lt;waihong@google.com&gt; Tested-by: Wai-Hong Tam &lt;waihong@google.com&gt; Reviewed-by: Nick Sanders &lt;nsanders@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="719596" owner_email="waihong@google.com" pass_count="0" patch_number="4" project="chromiumos/third_party/hdctools" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/third_party/hdctools" ref="refs/changes/96/719596/4" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="I34688d441135d685332168d6868dbf3301058097" commit="52433f121d74d8c9432bf591498fae78b77973e0" commit_message="ccd_cr50: Change cold_reset and warm_reset to active low  The cold_reset and warm_reset pins in the servoflex is active low. Change the Cr50 CCD driver of them to active low too in order to match the servoflex.  BUG=b:67756253 TEST=Started servo using Cr50 CCD. $ dut-control warm_reset:on warm_reset warm_reset:on $ dut-control warm_reset:off warm_reset warm_reset:off $ dut-control cold_reset:on cold_reset cold_reset:on $ dut-control cold_reset:off cold_reset cold_reset:off  Change-Id: I34688d441135d685332168d6868dbf3301058097 Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/719961 Commit-Ready: Wai-Hong Tam &lt;waihong@google.com&gt; Tested-by: Wai-Hong Tam &lt;waihong@google.com&gt; Reviewed-by: Nick Sanders &lt;nsanders@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Mary Ruthven &lt;mruthven@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="719961" owner_email="waihong@google.com" pass_count="0" patch_number="3" project="chromiumos/third_party/hdctools" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/third_party/hdctools" ref="refs/changes/61/719961/3" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="I91a4462ffbafb500c5b68fcc10395a79014d6755" commit="4f6a6a64dcd9bada27a8ebe60c689527cd9570c8" commit_message="scarlet: Remap the hpd config to warm_reset and change its setting  On scarlet and some new devices, servo headers may have warm_reset on pin 39, same as hpd. Change the board overlays to reflect this change.  BUG=b:67756253 TEST=sudo servod -b scarlet Saw they share the same config on Scarlet $ dut-control -i | grep -A2 -E '^(warm_reset|hpd)' hpd                               DOC: warm_reset --------------------------------- GET: {'map': 'onoff_i', 'clobber_ok': '', 'slv': '0x20', 'od': 'PU', 'drv': 'tca6416', 'init': 'off', 'offset': '2', 'interface': 2, 'port': '1'} --------------------------------- SET: {'map': 'onoff_i', 'clobber_ok': '', 'slv': '0x20', 'od': 'PU', 'drv': 'tca6416', 'init': 'off', 'offset': '2', 'interface': 2, 'port': '1'} -- warm_reset                        DOC: warm_reset --------------------------------- GET: {'map': 'onoff_i', 'clobber_ok': '', 'slv': '0x20', 'od': 'PU', 'drv': 'tca6416', 'init': 'off', 'offset': '2', 'interface': 2, 'port': '1'} --------------------------------- SET: {'map': 'onoff_i', 'clobber_ok': '', 'slv': '0x20', 'od': 'PU', 'drv': 'tca6416', 'init': 'off', 'offset': '2', 'interface': 2, 'port': '1'}  TEST=sudo servod -b soraka Saw they have different configs on non-Scarlet $ dut-control -i | grep -A2 -E '^(warm_reset|hpd)' hpd                               DOC: hpd --------------------------------- GET: {'map': 'onoff', 'offset': '2', 'interface': 2, 'slv': '0x20', 'port': '1', 'drv': 'tca6416'} --------------------------------- SET: {'map': 'onoff', 'offset': '2', 'interface': 2, 'slv': '0x20', 'port': '1',